{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/4089c2cacb63b8a6690b5019f2b92a46.avif?t=1773999219\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras_big/4089c2cacb63b8a6690b5019f2b92a46.avif?t=1773999219 width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trackastrophe! </strong>is a <strong>wholesome</strong> puzzle game about a kooky train engine traveling through surreal retro-cartoon-inspired worlds. Sit back, put your engineer cap on and go choo-choo!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze <strong>puzzle maps</strong>,<strong> find your path</strong> by building your tracks with a variety of different direction &amp; movement tiles - then pull that GO-lever and hope for the best!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/588ad5a4c3e319bf597cd1c0d4c770cd.poster.avif?t=1773999219\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/588ad5a4c3e319bf597cd1c0d4c770cd.webm?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/588ad5a4c3e319bf597cd1c0d4c770cd.mp4?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER DIFFERENT CARTOONY WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>100+ levels</strong> across several unique biomes, each including its own <strong>unique themes</strong> and <strong>mechanics</strong> - tunnels, portals, slippery ice and many other challenging traps. And, of course, some extra challenging bonus levels for those who dare! Enjoy the dreamlike music and atmosphere along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/86262eeb833a69d2535434b64d5f6e33.poster.avif?t=1773999219\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/86262eeb833a69d2535434b64d5f6e33.webm?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/86262eeb833a69d2535434b64d5f6e33.mp4?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVEL IN STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong>\u00a0the little gung-ho engine to your own style using the customization menu. Colors and hats galore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/b082e8ef9805015bada5900b432dbd21.poster.avif?t=1773999219\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/b082e8ef9805015bada5900b432dbd21.webm?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/b082e8ef9805015bada5900b432dbd21.mp4?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET THERE IN ONE PIECE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzle solution is always out there. Don't give up no matter the obstacle! (Or, try the hint system to help you out. We won't tell anyone!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/a21d046431456226170dcfd8cfab37e6.poster.avif?t=1773999219\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/a21d046431456226170dcfd8cfab37e6.webm?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/a21d046431456226170dcfd8cfab37e6.mp4?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All aboard! Get your ticket, and hop on the train ride.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419850?t=1773999219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773999219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/00cf337e39e9c05ac4c9216fa064cd0dd2d6d06f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773999219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/00cf337e39e9c05ac4c9216fa064cd0dd2d6d06f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773999219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3542440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/4089c2cacb63b8a6690b5019f2b92a46.avif?t=1773999219\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras_big/4089c2cacb63b8a6690b5019f2b92a46.avif?t=1773999219 width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trackastrophe! </strong>is a <strong>wholesome</strong> puzzle game about a kooky train engine traveling through surreal retro-cartoon-inspired worlds. Sit back, put your engineer cap on and go choo-choo!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze <strong>puzzle maps</strong>,<strong> find your path</strong> by building your tracks with a variety of different direction &amp; movement tiles - then pull that GO-lever and hope for the best!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/588ad5a4c3e319bf597cd1c0d4c770cd.poster.avif?t=1773999219\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/588ad5a4c3e319bf597cd1c0d4c770cd.webm?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/588ad5a4c3e319bf597cd1c0d4c770cd.mp4?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER DIFFERENT CARTOONY WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>100+ levels</strong> across several unique biomes, each including its own <strong>unique themes</strong> and <strong>mechanics</strong> - tunnels, portals, slippery ice and many other challenging traps. And, of course, some extra challenging bonus levels for those who dare! Enjoy the dreamlike music and atmosphere along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/86262eeb833a69d2535434b64d5f6e33.poster.avif?t=1773999219\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/86262eeb833a69d2535434b64d5f6e33.webm?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/86262eeb833a69d2535434b64d5f6e33.mp4?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVEL IN STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong>\u00a0the little gung-ho engine to your own style using the customization menu. Colors and hats galore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/b082e8ef9805015bada5900b432dbd21.poster.avif?t=1773999219\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/b082e8ef9805015bada5900b432dbd21.webm?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/b082e8ef9805015bada5900b432dbd21.mp4?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET THERE IN ONE PIECE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzle solution is always out there. Don't give up no matter the obstacle! (Or, try the hint system to help you out. We won't tell anyone!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/a21d046431456226170dcfd8cfab37e6.poster.avif?t=1773999219\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/a21d046431456226170dcfd8cfab37e6.webm?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/a21d046431456226170dcfd8cfab37e6.mp4?t=1773999219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All aboard! Get your ticket, and hop on the train ride.</p>","developers":["K